  "raw_output": "1. [ ] Check the event sign-up list and confirm the expected attendance count.\n2. [ ] Set aside one map and one scorecard per confirmed attendee. For **N attendees**, you need **N maps and N scorecards**.\n3. [ ] Recheck attendance immediately before assembly. If the count changes, adjust both material quantities to match the latest count.\n4. [ ] Assemble one kit per attendee, with one map and one scorecard in each. Count the completed kits and check their contents.\n5. [ ] Place all kits on the welcome table before doors open, allowing enough time for assembly and a final count.\n\nAttendance determines material quantities and the number of kits; assembly must finish before placement. If attendance changes after assembly, add or remove kits to match the updated count, then verify the table total before doors open.",
